# FEATURE_COVERAGE.md is generated by scripts/feature-coverage.mjs (npm run
# coverage:features) and rewritten by every agent as part of the Definition of Done gates.
# It conflicts on merges/cherry-picks constantly. Marking it linguist-generated collapses
# it in PR diffs so reviewers aren't shown a huge generated-file diff; it's still tracked
# (readable on GitHub) but CI, not the committed copy, is the actual enforcement — see
# docs/testing/TESTING.md ("Resolving FEATURE_COVERAGE.md conflicts") for the merge rule:
# always regenerate from the merged tree, never pick a side.
FEATURE_COVERAGE.md linguist-generated=true
